Firmware and software, including microcontroller code and the web frontend, are licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 or later (GPL-3.0-or-later).

Documentation, graphics, worksheets, and other educational material are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (CC BY-SA 4.0).

You are free to use, study, modify, manufacture, and redistribute the material in this repository in accordance with the terms of the respective licenses.

The intention of these licenses is to keep improvements and derivatives open and accessible to others.

Unless stated otherwise in an individual file or directory, the license categories above apply based on the type of material.